WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:05.060
Heave!

00:08.570 --> 00:10.860
Enemy forces are retreating!

00:10.860 --> 00:12.900
Victory is ours!

00:13.320 --> 00:14.630
Not yet!

00:14.630 --> 00:18.410
It's not a victory unless Wolff 
and the others are all right!

00:30.920 --> 00:32.280
Your Holiness.

00:32.280 --> 00:37.590
We've confirmed that the Other Worlder 
has been sent away from Samstag.

00:38.300 --> 00:43.230
We can assume it was by the power 
described in Ysha's report.

00:44.390 --> 00:46.120
Marvelous.

00:46.770 --> 00:50.520
Truly, he is the one I've been waiting for:

00:51.070 --> 00:53.780
this world's savior.

01:00.450 --> 01:02.790
Good work, everyone.

01:03.500 --> 01:05.580
Let's return to Gelb Castle.

01:06.210 --> 01:09.750
Someone who didn't do 
anything is taking charge.

01:09.750 --> 01:13.590
Hush! Don't say that about the poor man, Tama.

01:13.590 --> 01:17.590
S-Say whatever you wish. It doesn't bother me.

01:17.590 --> 01:19.950
Then I'll say some more.

01:19.950 --> 01:21.260
Tama! Bad!

01:21.260 --> 01:24.100
Sensei, we're heading back to the castle.

01:24.980 --> 01:26.270
Sensei?

01:26.270 --> 01:28.620
Looks like a new guest has arrived.

01:37.160 --> 01:38.630
You!

01:39.700 --> 01:41.660
The Fallen Angel of Misery!

01:43.000 --> 01:48.000
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

01:48.790 --> 01:53.800
Following Gluttony, 
Greed has been defeated, as well.

01:55.090 --> 01:56.420
Very well.

01:56.840 --> 02:00.640
Then I shall put an end to 
this with my own hands.

02:00.640 --> 02:02.640
This guy is strong!

02:02.640 --> 02:06.100
Actually, I appreciate this, Mr. Misery.

02:06.520 --> 02:10.350
If this had ended without an 
opportunity for me to show off,

02:10.350 --> 02:12.020
my self-respect would've suffered.

02:12.020 --> 02:13.980
<i>So it did bother him.</i>

02:14.270 --> 02:17.490
Sorry, but I'm going to tear you to pieces.

02:20.320 --> 02:23.330
Sturm und Drang!

02:26.910 --> 02:29.000
It's so powerful.

02:29.710 --> 02:33.750
Huh? Did I do something?

02:34.460 --> 02:35.500
Bishop Wolff!

02:37.670 --> 02:39.470
Unfortunately...

02:40.010 --> 02:42.720
magic is ineffective against my armor.

02:42.720 --> 02:47.430
Then I'll turn you into a 4WD, too!

02:52.100 --> 02:55.520
Sorry, but I'm used to 
defeating Fallen Angels!

02:55.520 --> 02:58.650
Divine Beast Feast Ultimate 
Technique: King's Fang!

02:59.200 --> 03:00.910
All right! A direct hit!

03:02.380 --> 03:06.120
Not bad. Your technique is decent...

03:06.660 --> 03:10.040
but you lack experience.

03:11.170 --> 03:13.540
No way...

03:14.210 --> 03:18.130
It's a shame to have to kill you, 
but you leave me no choice.

03:20.920 --> 03:21.720
Tama!

03:33.690 --> 03:35.310
<i>This sword...</i>

03:40.320 --> 03:42.950
Hone your skills, boy.

03:49.200 --> 03:51.580
We're saved?

03:51.580 --> 03:53.330
Nir!

03:54.080 --> 03:55.580
Nir!

03:54.920 --> 03:56.420
Boss!

03:56.420 --> 04:00.300
That's amazing! You chased 
off that Fallen Angel!

04:00.300 --> 04:03.340
I was just preoccupied with 
everything going on...

04:03.630 --> 04:05.640
You did great!

04:04.390 --> 04:06.390
You're so strong, Boss!

04:06.050 --> 04:07.890
You've changed so much!

04:06.390 --> 04:09.520
You're the boss, Boss!

04:14.480 --> 04:17.440
A great victory!

04:17.820 --> 04:22.950
Drink your fill today! We're celebrating!

04:28.280 --> 04:29.370
Honestly...

04:29.950 --> 04:32.080
I'm no match for them.

04:33.620 --> 04:35.830
After everything that happened,

04:36.460 --> 04:41.920
I'm glad the Other Worlder 
sisters got a happy ending.

04:42.590 --> 04:44.680
I'm not so sure they did.

04:46.840 --> 04:52.270
They were unhappy in their original 
world, but were they happy here?

04:52.850 --> 04:58.440
Were they not summoned for our convenience 
to experience unhappiness here, as well?

04:59.770 --> 05:06.490
Are the methods of His Holiness—
of all of us from Hellsehen truly right?

05:07.200 --> 05:08.320
Wolff...

05:37.850 --> 05:41.400
You contributed this time.

05:41.400 --> 05:44.610
You should be confident in yourself, Melos.

05:56.540 --> 05:59.540
Don't let it get you down, Melos.

05:59.540 --> 06:05.420
Sometimes your efforts are never rewarded, 
no matter how much you chase the one you love.

06:05.880 --> 06:08.180
Ow, ow, ow.

06:26.030 --> 06:27.490
Sacchan?

06:32.700 --> 06:34.660
It's good to see you again...

06:44.420 --> 06:45.710
Sensei.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.380
Sacchan...

06:52.140 --> 06:56.560
So you came to this world, too.

06:57.100 --> 06:59.230
I'm glad you're all right.

07:00.270 --> 07:02.600
I have so much to tell you.

07:04.730 --> 07:07.230
But first...

07:11.700 --> 07:13.570
Let's commit suicide together.

07:17.120 --> 07:20.790
Surely we can't fail if we 
jump from this height.

07:21.830 --> 07:24.250
Come with me, Sacchan.

07:30.130 --> 07:35.800
You've changed quite a bit 
since the last time I saw you.

07:36.430 --> 07:38.810
Now there's light in your eyes.

07:38.810 --> 07:41.770
You seem lively somehow.

07:42.730 --> 07:46.360
You're not the Sensei I know.

07:46.650 --> 07:49.990
Sacchan, I haven't changed.

07:49.990 --> 07:52.780
I've been wandering around like 
a sewer rat, just like I always—

07:52.780 --> 07:53.950
Sensei!

07:55.240 --> 07:57.450
Melos came rushing to get us.

07:57.450 --> 07:59.120
Did something happen?

07:59.120 --> 08:00.450
You...

08:05.040 --> 08:10.050
I see you found something better 
than death in this world.

08:12.130 --> 08:18.060
I can't be with you anymore.

08:20.540 --> 08:22.520
N-No, wait! Sacchan!

08:23.350 --> 08:24.400
Sacchan?

08:25.400 --> 08:28.440
So that's Sensei's...

08:31.070 --> 08:32.400
Sacchan...

08:44.320 --> 08:47.400
Thank you for the wonderful gifts.

08:47.920 --> 08:51.550
You're the one who made 
our equipment, right?

08:51.920 --> 08:54.880
It's so easy to use. I love it.

08:53.090 --> 08:54.840
<b>Blacksmiths' Guild
Guildmaster -  Rodos</b>

08:56.140 --> 08:59.720
Oh, yeah? Take good care of it.

08:59.720 --> 09:03.020
Come on, Sensei. Thank him for your coffin.

09:07.810 --> 09:09.480
You've got the wrong idea, Sacchan.

09:09.480 --> 09:12.090
I'm not lively at all. You've got it all wrong.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.090
S-Sensei?

09:12.090 --> 09:14.740
You've got it all wrong, Sacchan. 
I'm not lively at all.

09:14.740 --> 09:17.450
You've got it all wrong, Sacchan... 
You've got it all wrong...

09:19.740 --> 09:22.240
<b>Sensei used infinite
Calmotin (Infinite).</b>

09:22.240 --> 09:23.450
<b>Item was not
consumed
due to infinite
quantity.</b>

09:23.450 --> 09:25.080
<b>Item was not
consumed
due to infinite
quantity.</b>

09:25.080 --> 09:27.880
<b>Sensei used infinite
Calmotin (Infinite).</b>

09:27.880 --> 09:30.750
<b>Item was not
consumed
due to infinite
quantity.</b>

09:30.750 --> 09:33.840
<b>Sensei used infinite
Calmotin (Infinite).</b>

09:34.590 --> 09:35.920
Sensei!

09:35.920 --> 09:38.260
Annette, heal him! Heal him!

09:38.590 --> 09:39.550
Oh, right.

09:39.550 --> 09:42.510
Mister, could you take a look at this sword?

09:42.810 --> 09:45.230
Apparently, it was my dad's.

09:45.230 --> 09:49.520
It shattered a Fallen Angel's sword even 
though I'm not particularly strong.

09:49.520 --> 09:51.770
There's something up with it.

09:54.030 --> 09:55.070
Mister?

09:57.200 --> 10:00.990
This sword is too great for you.

10:03.740 --> 10:08.370
But you can someday become a 
warrior worthy of this sword.

10:09.330 --> 10:10.670
Mister...

10:15.670 --> 10:19.220
Its power is still an unruly 
horse in need of adjustment.

10:19.470 --> 10:22.180
If you're not careful, it'll kill you.

10:22.180 --> 10:27.430
Tonight I shall die. 
I ride so that it will kill me.

10:30.440 --> 10:32.020
Goodbye!

10:34.320 --> 10:36.070
S-Sensei...

10:36.070 --> 10:37.490
He's gone.

10:37.490 --> 10:41.070
Come on! Don't just stand there! Let's go!

10:41.070 --> 10:42.410
R-Right!

10:43.330 --> 10:44.580
Toru!

10:45.330 --> 10:47.000
Thanks for everything!

10:47.910 --> 10:54.000
Sure thing! Take care, all of you!

10:57.260 --> 11:01.150
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:57.770 --> 11:01.150
Tonight I Shall
Die, I Ride
So That It
Will Kill Me

11:01.150 --> 11:01.980
Tonight I Shall
Die, I Ride
So That It
Will Kill Me

11:01.150 --> 11:02.020
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:01.980 --> 11:02.020
Tonight I Shall
Die, I Ride
So That It
Will Kill Me

11:02.020 --> 11:02.060
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:02.020 --> 11:02.060
Tonight I Shall
Die, I Ride
So That It
Will Kill Me

11:02.070 --> 11:02.110
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:02.110 --> 11:02.190
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:02.190 --> 11:02.230
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:10.280 --> 11:14.840
You're normally so melancholy, 
but today you seem happy.

11:15.240 --> 11:17.780
Will it perhaps snow tomorrow?

11:28.100 --> 11:29.560
Good grief.

11:30.680 --> 11:33.310
You're in a good mood, as well.

11:36.230 --> 11:39.820
There were seven of us, 
and now we are only five.

11:39.820 --> 11:42.320
What am I to do with you people?

11:42.320 --> 11:47.370
All you do is idly stay cooped up in 
here watching the rest of the world.

11:47.370 --> 11:50.540
A slothful man like you is in no place to talk.

11:52.620 --> 11:54.670
I can't disagree with that.

11:54.670 --> 12:02.380
So, how was your reunion with our 
enemy—no, with the man you loved?

12:02.800 --> 12:07.350
He does indeed have the power 
to change this world.

12:07.680 --> 12:10.310
He's as wonderful as ever.

12:11.350 --> 12:15.770
That's what makes him worthy of me.

12:20.520 --> 12:24.150
I'd expect no less from our prideful queen.

12:27.700 --> 12:29.110
Oh, damn it!

12:29.490 --> 12:31.290
We totally lost him!

12:31.290 --> 12:33.300
How is that thing so fast, anyway?!

12:33.300 --> 12:37.790
We've become separated from Sensei and 
don't even know our current location.

12:37.790 --> 12:40.490
I'm such a failure.

12:40.490 --> 12:42.550
Are you lost?

12:42.840 --> 12:44.670
This is the village of Held.

12:44.670 --> 12:47.180
It was the hero's last stop.

12:47.180 --> 12:50.550
It's said that after relieving 
his exhaustion in this village,

12:50.550 --> 12:52.950
the hero went to the Dark Lord's castle.

12:52.950 --> 12:54.140
Huh.

12:54.460 --> 12:59.150
And this is the village's famous statue 
of the hero fighting the Dark Lord.

12:59.150 --> 13:02.190
But it looks like he's running 
away as fast as he can.

13:02.190 --> 13:03.470
Well, he's not!

13:03.800 --> 13:08.160
It was originally a heroic statue 
of the hero facing a monster.

13:08.450 --> 13:13.620
But a gloomy-faced man riding an 
odd vehicle just crashed into it.

13:13.620 --> 13:15.660
I hope he gets what's coming to him.

13:15.660 --> 13:17.410
<i>That's Sensei!</i>

13:17.410 --> 13:19.670
Let's hurry after him!

13:19.670 --> 13:21.250
Don't bother.

13:21.250 --> 13:24.800
He went speeding toward the shrine 
at the edge of the village.

13:24.800 --> 13:28.390
That shrine is the only route to Orange.

13:28.390 --> 13:30.720
You mean <i>that</i> Orange?

13:31.390 --> 13:34.840
The forbidden land of Orange 
where the Fairy Queen lives?

13:34.840 --> 13:36.890
F-Forbidden land?

13:36.890 --> 13:38.930
Is Sensei all right?

13:39.310 --> 13:41.110
Don't worry about him.

13:41.110 --> 13:44.230
No one can enter Orange without 
passing the trials first.

13:44.230 --> 13:45.780
Trials?

13:47.990 --> 13:49.660
Adventurer.

13:50.480 --> 13:55.530
Do you seek the protection 
of the Fairy Queen, as well?

13:55.540 --> 14:00.750
However, you will not be able to 
pass the trials that lie ahead.

14:01.000 --> 14:04.000
Turn back and leave this place.

14:05.380 --> 14:07.920
Don't speak directly into my head.

14:09.550 --> 14:11.590
First, there's a test of strength.

14:13.010 --> 14:15.680
I am the test of strength.

14:15.680 --> 14:19.100
If you wish to pass, you must overpower—

14:20.980 --> 14:22.650
Next, there's a test of intelligence.

14:22.650 --> 14:23.860
I am—

14:25.230 --> 14:26.900
Finally, there's a test of spirit.

14:28.840 --> 14:32.740
You must pass these three 
trials to enter Orange.

14:32.740 --> 14:34.740
It's not forbidden for nothing.

14:35.120 --> 14:38.620
Until now, only the hero passed the trials,
received the Fairy Queen's blessing,

14:38.620 --> 14:42.200
and traveled to the Dark Lord's castle.

14:42.200 --> 14:46.330
If you wait here, that man will be back soon.

14:46.330 --> 14:49.800
But what if he somehow passes the tests?

14:49.800 --> 14:51.340
You think Sensei can?

14:51.340 --> 14:53.050
No way!

14:59.430 --> 15:02.060
It's awfully smoky.

15:05.360 --> 15:06.270
Oh?

15:18.160 --> 15:19.450
Well, well.

15:20.000 --> 15:24.080
You're the second human to visit this place.

15:26.290 --> 15:28.840
Is this Paradise?

15:29.460 --> 15:33.220
I see. I finally died this time.

15:33.930 --> 15:37.050
This is Orange, land of the Fairy Queen.

15:37.050 --> 15:38.930
Bow your head, adventurer.

15:38.270 --> 15:40.520
<b>Fairy Twins 
\h\h\hSolulu\h\h\h</b>

15:38.270 --> 15:40.520
<b>Fairy Twins 
\h\h\h\hElulu\h\h\h\h</b>

15:38.930 --> 15:40.520
You're in the presence of the queen.

15:43.480 --> 15:45.690
How long are you going sit 
on the queen's breast?

15:45.690 --> 15:47.230
Get down from there!

15:48.940 --> 15:50.070
Excuse me.

15:50.860 --> 15:52.190
I'll kill you!

15:52.900 --> 15:56.120
Hold, Elulu and Solulu.

15:56.950 --> 15:59.740
I am Oberis the Fairy Queen.

15:59.740 --> 16:04.580
I grant my protection to 
those who reach this place.

16:04.810 --> 16:08.540
We fairies desire peace in this world.

16:08.340 --> 16:13.800
<b>Fairy Queen</b>

16:08.340 --> 16:13.800
<b>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hOberis\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h</b>

16:08.540 --> 16:13.800
Your duty is to accept my protection 
and fulfill that wish.

16:14.550 --> 16:17.640
Finally, chosen one, 
I have one question for you.

16:17.640 --> 16:21.270
Which is needed to save the world?

16:21.270 --> 16:25.470
Is it trust in others, or absolute power?

16:26.060 --> 16:28.400
Now choose.

16:28.230 --> 16:32.760
<b>m 0 0 l 130 0 130 45 0 45</b>

16:28.230 --> 16:32.760
<b>A. "Trust in others."
B. "Absolute power."</b>

16:32.570 --> 16:37.200
The one I trusted left me, 
so now I really want to die.

16:32.760 --> 16:41.160
<b>m 0 0 l 130 0 130 58 0 58</b>

16:32.760 --> 16:41.160
<b>C. "The one I trusted 
left me, so now 
I really want to die."</b>

16:37.200 --> 16:40.240
Hey! You're a human chosen 
by the Fairy Queen!

16:40.240 --> 16:41.160
Take this seriously!

16:41.490 --> 16:46.250
Good grief. The people of this 
world sure do love choices.

16:46.620 --> 16:49.710
It was only briefly that
I thought I died this time.

16:49.710 --> 16:52.210
I'm being asked to save the world again?

16:52.210 --> 16:55.170
Enough jokes. I've had enough.

16:55.170 --> 16:55.880
What?!

16:56.130 --> 17:02.090
Now that I've lost my soulmate, Sacchan, 
world peace doesn't matter to me.

17:02.600 --> 17:05.890
Let those who are suffering suffer 
and those who will fall fall.

17:06.890 --> 17:09.230
It's none of my business.

17:09.690 --> 17:11.900
Wh-What's wrong with this man?

17:11.900 --> 17:13.690
Is he out of his mind?

17:14.150 --> 17:18.450
It seems we were wrong about this man.

17:18.450 --> 17:21.080
I'm not so certain.

17:21.740 --> 17:25.370
He has Esche's protection.

17:25.370 --> 17:28.330
What? Esche, the spirit of the World Tree?

17:28.790 --> 17:31.790
<i>Esche is exceptionally sincere and earnest.</i>

17:32.210 --> 17:35.760
<i>Why did she choose this man?</i>

17:36.670 --> 17:39.640
What blessing did Esche grant you?

17:39.640 --> 17:41.050
Esche-kun, eh?

17:41.340 --> 17:44.810
She made these pills infinite.

17:44.810 --> 17:46.730
<i>Why, Esche?</i>

17:47.600 --> 17:49.190
Would you like some?

17:49.190 --> 17:51.570
Stop scattering those strange 
things on the queen's chest!

17:51.570 --> 17:52.940
I'll kill you!

17:52.940 --> 17:53.610
Thank you.

17:53.610 --> 17:54.820
Are you invincible or something?!

17:54.820 --> 17:58.070
My queen, we should send this 
good-for-nothing back right away!

17:58.400 --> 18:00.950
Heed me, Elulu and Solulu.

18:01.520 --> 18:07.040
A man people called a hero once came to 
this land and received my protection,

18:07.040 --> 18:12.080
but he failed to bring peace to this world.

18:12.740 --> 18:17.950
And now, Zauberberg has fallen 
into even greater chaos.

18:18.260 --> 18:22.910
The elves in the north call themselves 
"Hellsehen" and observe the world.

18:23.260 --> 18:27.560
Seven fallen humans defeated 
the ruler of dragonkind.

18:28.850 --> 18:32.980
Now countless Other Worlders 
have entered the mix,

18:32.980 --> 18:36.190
blurring the line between good and evil.

18:36.820 --> 18:41.780
There's nothing those with righteous 
hearts who make only righteous choices

18:41.780 --> 18:44.660
can do about this anymore.

18:45.780 --> 18:47.490
Queen Oberis...

18:47.950 --> 18:54.920
I believe that it wasn't a mistake 
that this man came to this land.

18:55.710 --> 18:59.880
It was the world that led him here.

19:09.140 --> 19:10.770
Adventurer.

19:11.270 --> 19:16.980
You and your soulmate will be reunited 
at the end of your journey.

19:17.690 --> 19:20.950
I will not ask you to save the world.

19:21.400 --> 19:25.410
Instead, live a while longer 
and continue your journey.

19:26.200 --> 19:28.990
That must be what the world wants.

19:30.250 --> 19:32.670
Reunited, huh?

19:33.620 --> 19:39.840
That's no consolation, but you're 
attempting to cheer me up, aren't you?

19:40.210 --> 19:42.630
Thank you, giant lady.

19:43.010 --> 19:45.350
You are a very kind woman.

19:46.300 --> 19:47.540
How impudent.

19:47.930 --> 19:50.680
Here is your parting gift.

19:51.430 --> 19:54.730
Blow this whistle when you 
are faced with trouble.

19:55.150 --> 19:57.940
The fairies shall grant you our strength.

19:55.730 --> 19:57.940
<b>m 0 0 l 112 0 112 58 0 58</b>

19:55.730 --> 19:57.940
<b>Sensei acquired 
the Fairy Queen's 
Whistle.</b>

19:58.320 --> 20:01.600
Farewell, mysterious adventurer.

20:04.910 --> 20:08.370
Honestly. What a strange man, Elulu.

20:08.370 --> 20:10.950
Indeed, Sister Solulu.

20:10.950 --> 20:12.450
And you, my queen.

20:12.820 --> 20:15.250
How could you offer him our strength?

20:16.830 --> 20:18.790
What are you laughing about?

20:21.630 --> 20:26.180
Calm down, Annette. 
He'll come back eventually.

20:27.050 --> 20:29.260
And then what?

20:30.060 --> 20:35.640
Will Sensei continue traveling now that the 
person he's been looking for rejected him?

20:35.920 --> 20:37.230
Good point.

20:37.230 --> 20:38.730
I refuse!

20:38.730 --> 20:41.980
Our journey can't end here!

20:41.980 --> 20:43.980
After all, I care deeply for—

20:55.040 --> 20:57.040
S-Sensei?!

21:03.210 --> 21:05.300
Sorry to make you worry.

21:07.720 --> 21:11.730
Hold it! What have you done 
now?! The hero's statue...

21:11.730 --> 21:14.680
has taken on its worst form yet!

21:20.610 --> 21:23.650
Huh? What? What is this?

21:21.360 --> 21:23.650
Wow, a fairy.

21:23.650 --> 21:25.030
So cute.

21:25.030 --> 21:25.610
Hello.

21:25.610 --> 21:27.110
You!

21:27.780 --> 21:30.490
Do you think you could fix this statue?

21:30.490 --> 21:32.790
What?! Why would I—

21:35.040 --> 21:35.950
My queen!

21:37.920 --> 21:41.170
When you said the fairies 
would lend their strength...

21:41.880 --> 21:44.090
Good luck, Solulu.

21:44.090 --> 21:46.130
You can do it, Sister.

21:47.430 --> 21:49.260
No way!

21:48.260 --> 21:50.220
If you please.

21:50.220 --> 21:51.050
Huh?!

21:51.050 --> 21:52.550
Wait, Sensei!

21:52.550 --> 21:54.680
What are we supposed to do about this?

21:56.270 --> 21:58.310
That good-for-nothing!

22:00.210 --> 22:06.400
<b>m 0 0 l 135 0 135 58 0 58</b>

22:00.210 --> 22:06.400
<b>Sensei has gained
the ability to summon
Solulu the Fairy!</b>

22:00.230 --> 22:03.900
I'll kill him!

22:11.820 --> 22:14.120
Honestly, that group...

22:14.120 --> 22:17.080
I can't believe they left 
without saying goodbye.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.670
Sounds like them.

22:19.670 --> 22:23.750
Don't you need to take 
that man to see the pope?

22:24.590 --> 22:25.460
It's fine.

22:25.750 --> 22:29.550
It was wrong for us to intervene.

22:34.890 --> 22:38.100
The world wants something from him.

22:38.770 --> 22:43.520
Is it peace, or...

22:46.830 --> 22:48.610
Is it chaos?

22:54.020 --> 23:00.230
Either way, the fate of the world 
has been entrusted to them.

23:08.870 --> 23:12.940
Sensei! Where are you going?

23:16.560 --> 23:18.020
Wait for us.

23:18.020 --> 23:20.660
This one's heavier than the last one.

23:25.190 --> 23:26.560
Sensei?

23:33.440 --> 23:34.600
Come.

23:36.010 --> 23:37.780
Let's continue our journey.
